<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">11072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>American forces struck one hundred and seventy targets across Iran this week, the Pentagon says, as Washington declared the June ceasefire dead and Tehran's foreign minister flew to Muscat seeking guarantees for safe passage through the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>Roughly a fifth of the world's oil moves through that narrow waterway, and the war has turned its reopening into a bargaining chip.</s> <s>Qatar is now pressing both sides back toward talks.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Sudan's army has recaptured the city of Kurmuk on the Blue Nile from the Rapid Support Forces, seizing back a paramilitary supply corridor that ran in from neighbouring Ethiopia.</s> <s>Nearly one hundred thousand people fled when the city fell in March, and this war rarely reaches the Western wires at all.</s> <s>Displaced families can only return once military engineers clear the explosive remnants left behind.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>I saw a stray dog carrying a toddler's arm.</s> <s>Two women told a jury at London's Old Bailey that livestreamed footage from Gaza drove them to raid an Israeli-owned Elbit arms factory near Bristol in twenty twenty-four.</s> <s>Hannah Davidson and Teuta Hoxha deny violent disorder — a case that puts Britain's weapons supply chain and Gaza's dead in the same courtroom.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Nigerian federal court has ordered the police to pay one hundred million naira over the killing of twenty-two-year-old Onyekachi Mba.</s> <s>Officers shot him at the Cross River governor's residence after he insisted on delivering a message, and he later died of his wounds.</s> <s>Judge Ojukwu called it executive recklessness, though no officer yet faces charges.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Witnesses in Houston are disputing the American government's account of how an immigration agent shot and killed Lorenzo Salgado Araujo.</s> <s>Homeland Security says he rammed an agent's vehicle; the witnesses say the agent fired first, through a passenger window.</s> <s>Mexico's president says she'll ask US prosecutors to open a criminal investigation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At least twelve people are dead and nineteen missing after a wildfire tore through the hills near Almería in southern Spain.</s> <s>Most victims died fleeing on foot after a downed power line ignited tinder-dry brush during the country's third heatwave in six weeks.</s> <s>Search teams are still combing the scorched terrain as the heat refuses to break.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia has banned gasoline and diesel exports through the end of July after Ukrainian drone strikes knocked refineries offline, and Deputy Prime Minister Novak has now admitted the fuel shortages are real.</s> <s>It's a rare public concession that the war has reached ordinary Russian pumps.</s> <s>Novak won't say whether the ban holds if the strikes continue past the month's end.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Emirati telecoms group e and has sold its entire sixteen percent stake in Vodafone for nearly six billion dollars, and French billionaire Xavier Niel's investment vehicle has become the telecom giant's largest shareholder.</s> <s>Niel paid a fifteen percent premium to take control.</s> <s>He once cut Tele2's workforce by fifteen percent after a similar move, and unions across Europe are watching closely.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India has commissioned the <sub alias="warship Mahendragiri">INS Mahendragiri</sub>, a stealth frigate with roughly three-quarters of its hull and systems built at home.</s> <s>It's the sixth ship in a class designed to cut India's long reliance on Russian and Western naval suppliers.</s> <s>Five sister vessels have entered service since January of last year, part of a push to build an indigenous naval-industrial base for the Indian Ocean.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Italian scientists have measured one of Einstein's stranger predictions — frame dragging, the way a spinning Earth drags spacetime around with it — to within two-tenths of a percent.</s> <s>The Italian Space Agency's mirror-covered <sub alias="Lares two">LARES-2</sub> satellite, paired with an older NASA craft, let lasers separate that rotational drag from the planet's uneven shape.</s> <s>That result narrows, without ruling out, rival theories that would revise gravity itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google engineers have taught a quantum chip to fix itself, reusing the error-correction data that already flows through the machine to drive learning across forty thousand control parameters.</s> <s>That let the processor catch calibration drift mid-calculation, for a twenty percent gain in error detection.</s> <s>Researchers caution the trick only holds if the hardware stays stable, but it turns a constant headache into a byproduct of work the machine already does.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's capital has approved its first framework to regulate virtual schools, setting standards for teacher training, cybersecurity, and curriculum.</s> <s>The rules aim to reach out-of-school children and students in remote areas, where online classrooms have grown with little oversight.</s> <s>Other provinces may adopt the same framework, in sha'Allah, if Islamabad's experiment holds.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The European Parliament has passed a law nicknamed Chat Control, letting platforms like Google, Meta, and Microsoft scan private messages for child-abuse material.</s> <s>It's the bloc's biggest concession yet against end-to-end encryption, the technology that keeps a message readable only by its sender and receiver.</s> <s>Platforms must now decide whether to build the scanning tools, and privacy advocates warn the same machinery could later hunt for anything at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Chinese AI models like DeepSeek now dominate adoption across much of Africa, because Beijing publishes their inner workings free for any developer to run and modify.</s> <s>Closed American models, by contrast, are reachable only through a company's prompt.</s> <s>The researcher Andrew Ng warns that whichever nation's models answer the world's questions may quietly shape how the world thinks.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>